I built the issue desk in one file, `src/main.rx`, with `App` as the entry and tabs for issues, help and settings; `./check` passes and all 30 visible tests pass. I used 14 of the 15 check/test runs. The unsure parts are that the help page's "searching…" line is only checked on the first search, because the visible tests never exercise a second one, and that the assign error shows the server's bare message while the other detail errors carry a prefix, as the brief spells them.